// Purpose: plant pot with saucer (assembly) – pot as a loft from the rounded square
// (superellipse as spline, points from a function) to the round opening, feet and
// drain holes; saucer as rotate_extrude opened at the top with shell and rounded via
// zones. The pot stands with the anchor `footing` on the anchor `floor` of the saucer.
// Check: `mcad measure planter.mcad --interference --clearance pot saucer`. Dimensions in mm.
include <dimensions.mcad>
use <parts.mcad>

saucer: saucer();
translate(saucer.floor) pot: pot();
